  "prefLabel": "Auc 103.01 Composition of the Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Auc 103.01 Composition of the Board.\n\n(a) The board consists of members who meet the eligibility requirements of RSA 311-B:2.\n\n(b) The board shall elect a chair at its first regular meeting of the calendar year.\n\nSource. #6657, eff 1-1-98; ss by #12155, eff 4-5-17; ss by #14500, eff 2-8-26",
